Subject: [PATCH] standing_desk_height: reject incomplete Jarvis height payloads

Proposed upstream change: https://github.com/tjhorner/esphome-standing-desk
Based on commit a60a3beca59b4ca8ffffa0e3fa542bc98535d3e9.
Height decoding reads two bytes. Reject shorter checksummed HEIGHT messages
without changing framing or valid height reports.
This patch is not applied by the Upsy Desky firmware packages.

diff --git a/components/standing_desk_height/jarvis_decoder.cpp b/components/standing_desk_height/jarvis_decoder.cpp
--- a/components/standing_desk_height/jarvis_decoder.cpp
+++ b/components/standing_desk_height/jarvis_decoder.cpp
@@ -67,7 +67,7 @@
     return false;
   }
 
-  return complete && cmd == HEIGHT;
+  return complete && cmd == HEIGHT && argc >= 2;
 }
 
 float JarvisDecoder::decode() {
